id: genes-of-a-warrior-clan
name: Genes of a Warrior Clan
order: 1
optionOf: namekian-genes
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points on the Wound Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency.
text: >
  Genes of a Warrior Clan [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points on the Wound Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency.

---

# Asked on an attack's Wound Roll with 2+ Adaptation Points spent on it - half your Surgency on it, once a Round (chat.mjs rollSide).
[passive]
allow namekianGenes.warrior;
